/ Stage 12 (decision 87): setting.Set throws NotSupportedException, which drops the error's key and status. An unknown
/ option is an error result that keeps them.
Start
- set %!llm.nosuchoption% = 1, on error set %key% = %!error.key%
- assert %key% is not null
- assert %key% is not "ServiceError", "the error keeps its own key"
